# Merge failures (triggered by values starting with '!'):
# - "!init" fails in Merge()
# - "!older" fails in MergeOlder()
# - "!finish" fails in Finish()
# - "!finish-close-ok" fails in Finish() and returns a closer that succeeds
# - "!finish-close-err" fails in Finish() and returns a closer that fails
# - "!corrupt" fails with a corruption error, aborting the compaction
# - any other "!" prefix fails at whichever stage encounters it
# When merging fails for a key in a stripe, all MERGE operands in that stripe
# are emitted uncombined at their original sequence numbers (never zeroed or
# converted to SET, even at the bottommost layer), and any trailing SET or
# deletion tombstone in the stripe is processed normally from its position.

